The modifier keys as the last key event left them (docs/w6.md W6b).
GTK's and WPE's ports answer "which modifiers are held now" from the state
the platform last set with setCurrentModifierState, and so does Kosmos,
whose keys arrive as the window manager's events and never by asking the
keyboard. Until JetSki has a window (W7) nothing has set it, and no
modifier is held.

